  "labeler_notes": "All 178 titles are 'Hardware Group No. X' on pp.715-836 (08 71 00, Bulletin T039); identifiers include dots, letters and hyphens (e.g. '005.1', 'K201ACTW.1', 'V-731CR'). No struck text on p.716. Set 101 HINGE: the line '(PROVIDE NRP @ OUTSWING, LOCKABLE DOORS)' starts a new line in the catalog column and is a separate parenthesised remark, so it is the row's notes (parentheses kept as printed) and catalog_number is '5BB1 4.5 X 4.5'. By contrast 'OFFICE FUNCTION' on the line under '64-8205 FEJ 26D' is treated as a wrapped catalog line (not parenthesised) -> '64-8205 FEJ 26D OFFICE FUNCTION'. GASKETING '(USE SILENCERS @ NON-RATED DOORS)' begins on the same line as '488S PSA H & J', so it stays inside catalog_number.",
